<title>CHILE: Copec sees $400 mln investments in 1997.</title>
<headline>Copec sees $400 mln investments in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean oil and paper pulp company Compania de Petroleos de Chile SA, or Copec, expects business investments this year to reach $400 million, chief executive officer Felipe Lamarca said.</p>
<p>Lamarca was speaking at a Copec shareholders' conference.</p>
</text>
